AMENDMENTS & MODIFICATIONS
==========================
VERSION 0.00   Demo trial version only released on limited distribution,
               version 0.xx series of the program has limited life.
               Defaults cannot be saved using version 0.00
               
VERSION 1.00   Initial general release of the program, separate versions
               for the series 3 and 3a. Versions for 3 and 3a are very
               similar at this stage. New password required from version 0.00
               Unregistered version of 1.00 will store default file in 1994.
               Info option on menu removed - info displayed via registration
               option.

VERSION 1.01   Mobile operation entries can now be entered in the log and are
               highlighted in the ouput log by a "M" after the date.
               Date field in logfile includes the start time so that entries
               can be edited at any stage and the file sorted so that 
               chronologial order of database can be maintained.

VERSION 1.06   Minor changes and 5 characters allowed in band description.

VERSION 1.10   Major re-release - minor changes for user - downward compatible
               with earlier version. Search facility included in registered
               version.

VERSION 1.50   Minor Changes and improvements - unregistered version will now
               live through 1995.
              
VERSION 1.60   Minor Changes due to gaining popularity with Psion Users.

